==Description==
The '''Heatwave Nametag''' is a nametag that could be obtained at Level 38 of the regular [[Surf & Turf Battle Pass]] track. At that Level, it had a cost of {{BeachBalls|1,360}} or {{Robux|84}} to unlock, with a total cost of {{BeachBalls|24,220}} or {{Robux|3,507}}. This item also has had two other costs. First one was the cost before its 20% discount, which had a cost of {{Robux|106}} with a total cost of {{Robux|4,404}}. The second was the price prior to the [[Surf & Turf Battle Pass]] individual skip cost fix, where it had a total cost of {{Robux|3,322}}. 

The '''Heatwave Nametag''' has a black to orange gradient text with a black outline. Black and orange smoke, yellow sparks and black tumbleweed also appears behind the text, moving from left to right.

